:exactly;color:#787580">Thanks for your time on the call yesterday. As promised, here are the electric options that fit the budget we talked about, all on 36 months with 8,000 miles a year.</p><p style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#787580">Prices move quickly on these, so if one stands out let me know this week and I&#39;ll hold the quote for you.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:12px 24px 8px 24px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:0 0 20px 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:separate;table-layout:fixed"><tbody><tr><td style="border:1px solid #E1E0E4;border-radius:16px;padding:0;background:#FFFFFF"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:0"><img src="https://offers.dreamlease.co.uk/a/vehicle-placeholder.png" width="592" height="444" alt="BYD Seal" align="center" style="display:block;border:0;width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:15px 15px 0 0"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:22px 22px 24px 22px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tbody><tr><td height="24" valign="top" style="height:24px;padding:0 0 10px 0;vertical-align:top;font-size:12px"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:0 6px 0 0;vertical-align:top"><!--[if mso]><v:roundrect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" style="height:24px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:170px" arcsize="50%" stroke="f" fillcolor="#FF8811"><w:anchorlock/><v:textbox inset="0,0,0,0"><center style="color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial, 'Helvetica N